PRJNA1017890	SRP460845	SRR26074298	SRX21789220	SAMN37417060	GSM7784274: Col-0, drought, polysomal RNA, replicate 1; Arabidopsis thaliana; RNA-Seq	GSM7784274	GSM7784274	Arabidopsis thaliana	mRNA ADENOSINE METHYLASE promotes drought tolerance through N6-methyladenosine-dependent and independent impacts on mRNA regulation in Arabidopsis		Drought	Col-0, drought, polysomal RNA, replicate 1	WT	STRESSED		leaves	leaf	Water withholding	12	Drought	Flowering stage	Col‐0 and mta	Watering was withheld for one group in order to progressively induce drought for 12 d, whereas the control group received regular watering		Seeds were planted on soil‐filled pots (11 × 9 cm) and kept at 4°C for 3 d for stratification. Seeds were transferred to a growth chamber maintained under 8 h : 16 h, 22°C : 20°C, light : dark for 8 d. Germinated seedlings were then transferred to a growth chamber under a 12 h : 12 h, 22°C : 20°C, light : dark for 9 d. These 17‐d‐old seedlings were watered to soil capacity, then divided into two groups	32
